  "bio": "Artists\nSuppliers\nAbout\nDiscover the avant-garde of ink at Error 404 Tattoo Workshop, nestled in the historical heart of Dijon, France. Specializing in the bold and rebellious trashpolka style, our acclaimed resident artists—@dronn.art, @cruellatpique, and @oswin_ink—transform your skin into a canvas of striking, high-contrast masterpieces. Step into our domain where artistry meets precision, but remember, for bookings and inquiries, leave DMs behind and connect with us directly.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Dijon, Bourgogne-franche-comte, France"
}